; cluster for molecular structure: molecule, chemical bonds, covalent, ionic, hydrogen bonds.
; molecules form when atoms share or transfer electrons — sandhi at chemical scale.
; molecular geometry determines chemical properties.
; sangati roots

(kosha molecular-varga
  (vishesa chemistry-varga)
  (swarupa subanta sandhi)
  (yukta mula-shakti spanda avastha niyama))
